# Page builder: Style tab and backgrounds

## Widgets and kits

- Register the block `type` in the widget style-group map with at least `layout` and `spacing` (or the full set it needs); every registered group has controls.
- Styled blocks render through the shared styled-leaf wrapper and widget style CSS.
- No insertable block has an empty Style tab. Style colours honour light/dark (`cms-builder/dark-mode.mdc`).

## Containers (band / row / column)

Each exposes:
1. **Background** — `settings.background` via the shared background fields.
2. **Container chrome** — `styles` via the style panel with the container style type (layout + spacing + border + custom).
3. **Public render** — the layout node shell applies both the background layer and the styled CSS vars.

## Backgrounds

| Type | Use |
|------|-----|
| `none` | Default |
| `color` | Solid fill |
| `gradient` | Linear (from / to / angle) |
| `image` | Media-library image + size, optional colour overlay (opacity 0–100), lazy by default |
| `particles` / `animated_rain` | Canvas animations |

- Choosing colour or gradient writes default values immediately so the preview updates.
- **Images always come from the media library**, never a pasted URL — in every builder field.
- Optional `background.dark` holds dark overrides; the type is shared.
- Embedded kits must not paint opaque section fills that hide parent backgrounds.
- Honour `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` (animations static or off).
- New animated presets are new `background.type` values with an admin option and a public layer component — no one-off CSS on bands.
- Shape dividers use preset SVGs only; never accept operator-uploaded SVG markup there.

## Checklist

- [ ] Widget: style groups + Style tab + public wrapper
- [ ] Container: background + container style panel + shell `styles`
- [ ] Preview matches the public page
- [ ] Grid kits follow `cms-builder/grid-columns.mdc`
